1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,646
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:31,906
<i>The case against me is dismissed.</i>
<i>I will be going back to the capitol</i>

6
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:37,162
<i>to claim my rightful title</i>
<i>as governor of Ardiente.</i>

7
00:00:37,245 --> 00:00:39,330
[woman] <i>Lily Cruz did book a flight.</i>

8
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:40,957
[Helena] <i>So, what are you waiting for?</i>

9
00:00:41,041 --> 00:00:42,876
<i>I have a concert to do tonight.</i>

10
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:44,002
<i>Do not disturb me.</i>

11
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:46,296
<i>Go after Lily Cruz!</i>

12
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,256
[Julio] <i>Arnaldo! What happened to you?</i>

13
00:00:48,339 --> 00:00:50,759
<i>Lily said I killed her Nanny Carlotta.</i>

14
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:52,051
<i>Am I a bad person?</i>

15
00:00:52,135 --> 00:00:54,387
[Julio] <i>No. You are not a bad person.</i>

16
00:00:54,471 --> 00:00:57,223
<i>It's time for you to come home.</i>

17
00:00:57,307 --> 00:00:59,142
<i>You'll come to the mansion</i>
<i>whether you like it or not.</i>

18
00:00:59,225 --> 00:01:01,811
<i>And suspiciously,</i>
<i>why isn't Lily Cruz here?</i>

19
00:01:01,895 --> 00:01:03,104
<i>Piece of advice.</i>

20
00:01:03,188 --> 00:01:08,193
<i>Don't believe that she's leaving</i>
<i>because Lily Cruz never flees.</i>

21
00:01:08,276 --> 00:01:11,321
<i>And more importantly, she never dies.</i>

22
00:01:11,404 --> 00:01:13,656
<i>The Dragon Ladies have been</i>
<i>arrested by the police.</i>

23
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:15,450
[Mercedes] <i>They are questioning</i>
<i>them about you.</i>

24
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,577
<i>They know you're Red Dragon.</i>

25
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,871
[Emilia] <i>Tonight we are</i>
<i>celebrating the anniversary</i>

26
00:01:19,954 --> 00:01:21,873
<i>of Helena Montoya's foundation.</i>

27
00:01:21,956 --> 00:01:23,166
[Helena] <i>This night is especially</i>

28
00:01:23,249 --> 00:01:25,460
<i>for the people of Ardiente.</i>

29
00:01:25,543 --> 00:01:30,965
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>
<i>I recognize the one, the only…</i>

30
00:01:31,049 --> 00:01:32,550
[Lily] <i>Lily Cruz.</i>

31
00:01:32,634 --> 00:01:34,969
[Myla] <i>And I guarantee you that Red Dragon</i>

32
00:01:35,053 --> 00:01:37,347
<i>is none other than Helena Montoya.</i>

33
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:41,351
[Lily] <i>Everyone here knows</i>
<i>that Helena Montoya</i>

34
00:01:41,434 --> 00:01:45,230
<i>is none other than Red Dragon.</i>

35
00:01:48,858 --> 00:01:51,903
Oh, Helena, sorry. The show is over

36
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:58,326
because the whole world
now knows your secret, Red Dragon.

37
00:01:58,952 --> 00:02:01,704
Me? "Red Dragon"?

38
00:02:01,788 --> 00:02:03,998
Careful with your accusations.

39
00:02:04,666 --> 00:02:07,836
My lawyers can sue you for libel.

40
00:02:07,919 --> 00:02:10,880
You've got no evidence, Lily Cruz.

41
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,723
You knew about this, didn't you?

42
00:02:20,807 --> 00:02:22,475
I don't know what you're talking about!

43
00:02:23,977 --> 00:02:24,978
We aren't done yet.

44
00:02:25,061 --> 00:02:27,480
Don't point fingers without proof.

45
00:02:27,564 --> 00:02:30,775
Red Dragon will still trust me
because I'm more useful.

46
00:02:31,693 --> 00:02:33,319
-You bastard!
-Yeah?

47
00:02:36,489 --> 00:02:39,200
Drop the act, Helena.

48
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,661
You want evidence?

49
00:02:42,328 --> 00:02:45,707
I don't just accuse people without proof.

50
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:54,132
Here.

51
00:02:54,799 --> 00:02:57,594
Bank statements.
Oh, maybe you missed this.

52
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:01,556
Does it look familiar?
It's your blue book.

53
00:03:03,558 --> 00:03:08,897
And these are papers proving
that your business is illegal.

54
00:03:10,565 --> 00:03:17,530
And I also have the list
of people you wanted dead

55
00:03:17,614 --> 00:03:19,616
after this special occasion.

56
00:03:20,408 --> 00:03:25,663
Do you want to know who's
on Red Dragon's hit list?

57
00:03:28,166 --> 00:03:34,964
Topping her list is none other
than Salvador Tatad.

58
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:37,175
[Helena] That's not true.

59
00:03:37,258 --> 00:03:38,718
[Lily] Isagani Bacaro.

60
00:03:38,801 --> 00:03:39,802
[Helena] No.

61
00:03:39,886 --> 00:03:43,806
Leticia Hidalgo. Horacio Perez.

62
00:03:43,890 --> 00:03:46,184
-That is not true!
-[Lily] It'd actually take us

63
00:03:46,267 --> 00:03:50,563
all night if I read
the whole list, so I'll stop.

64
00:03:50,647 --> 00:03:52,941
But if some of you are still wondering,

65
00:03:53,024 --> 00:03:54,609
well, you'd better believe it.

66
00:03:54,692 --> 00:03:57,237
I myself was duped.

67
00:03:57,320 --> 00:04:00,448
We were all conned by Helena Montoya.

68
00:04:01,115 --> 00:04:05,161
She pretended to love us,
but the truth is,

69
00:04:05,245 --> 00:04:08,706
we were merely playthings in her schemes.

70
00:04:09,207 --> 00:04:13,962
I'm not doing anything illegal,
but you certainly are.

71
00:04:14,045 --> 00:04:16,256
I'll sue you for libel!

72
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:19,175
Are you sure you're clean?

73
00:04:20,093 --> 00:04:20,885
Here.

74
00:04:22,178 --> 00:04:23,554
See for yourself, Helena!

75
00:04:25,056 --> 00:04:26,975
What are these? Photoshopped!

76
00:04:27,058 --> 00:04:28,935
-These are fake!
-[Lily laughs]

77
00:04:29,269 --> 00:04:30,520
They're fake! They were photoshopped!

78
00:04:30,603 --> 00:04:32,689
They will never hold in court!

79
00:04:32,772 --> 00:04:34,524
You're the fake.

80
00:04:40,738 --> 00:04:43,658
I am Helena Montoya!

81
00:04:45,034 --> 00:04:46,869
I'm a philanthropist.

82
00:04:46,953 --> 00:04:48,913
I help the poor.

83
00:04:49,163 --> 00:04:53,960
I will not allow someone
like Lily Cruz to slander me.

84
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:57,213
[sighs]

85
00:04:57,297 --> 00:05:01,301
Sorry. This Lily Cruz just did it.

86
00:05:07,432 --> 00:05:10,184
Oh! And in case you were wondering,

87
00:05:10,268 --> 00:05:16,316
the authorities already have
copies of the evidence I have.

88
00:05:17,525 --> 00:05:18,443
Hi, sir!

89
00:05:28,661 --> 00:05:31,164
[Lily] Aww. They're about to arrest you.

90
00:05:31,247 --> 00:05:36,169
Helena Montoya, you are under
arrest for arms trafficking

91
00:05:36,252 --> 00:05:37,378
and human trafficking.

92
00:05:39,213 --> 00:05:40,214
[Agent Asuncion] Let's go.

93
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,010
-Please come with us.
-Let go of me!

94
00:05:44,093 --> 00:05:46,137
-Wait! You cannot do this to my mama!
-Don't touch me!

95
00:05:49,348 --> 00:05:50,183
This isn't over.

96
00:05:56,522 --> 00:05:57,857
She hasn't done anything!

97
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:00,526
And you! You little witch!

98
00:06:01,194 --> 00:06:02,653
Who do you think you are, huh?

99
00:06:02,904 --> 00:06:04,405
You cannot do this to my mama!

100
00:06:04,947 --> 00:06:07,283
Why, Emilia?
Are you jealous of your mother?

101
00:06:07,366 --> 00:06:09,118
Do you want to join her in jail?

102
00:06:10,244 --> 00:06:13,664
You don't belong there.
I have other plans for you.

103
00:06:13,748 --> 00:06:14,832
This isn't over!

104
00:06:14,916 --> 00:06:16,417
You've got that right…

105
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:17,752
-…because you're next!
-We'll never be over!

106
00:06:17,835 --> 00:06:20,963
I'll make sure you'll be done for, Emilia.

107
00:06:25,885 --> 00:06:28,012
-[Anna] Aunt Camia.
-Anna.

108
00:06:28,096 --> 00:06:29,722
Helena Montoya is being arrested.

109
00:06:29,806 --> 00:06:32,934
Thank goodness! How's Lily? Is she safe?

110
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:35,603
Don't worry. Lily's doing fine.

111
00:06:39,524 --> 00:06:40,733
[ominous music]

112
00:06:46,739 --> 00:06:49,659
[phone vibrating]

113
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:53,579
[phone vibrating]

114
00:06:54,497 --> 00:06:55,373
Hello?

115
00:06:55,456 --> 00:06:58,167
Boss Jaguar, they're arresting
Madam Red Dragon.

116
00:06:58,251 --> 00:06:59,043
We're moving in.

117
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:00,628
-Don't.
<i>-Boss…</i>

118
00:07:00,711 --> 00:07:03,131
If we won't do something,
Madam will be behind bars.

119
00:07:03,214 --> 00:07:05,049
Use your damn head.

120
00:07:05,633 --> 00:07:08,511
By meddling, you'll only
make her look suspicious.

121
00:07:09,262 --> 00:07:10,346
<i>Back off now.</i>

122
00:07:10,888 --> 00:07:12,140
And that is an order.

123
00:07:14,559 --> 00:07:15,560
Back off!

124
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:19,188
Boss Jaguar wants us to back off.

125
00:07:19,272 --> 00:07:21,983
-What?
-Just back off! Let's go!

126
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:42,587
<i>I know how much it will pain</i>
<i>you if Lily gets hurt.</i>

127
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:45,298
<i>I won't let that happen.</i>

128
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:48,259
<i>You'll never have to worry again, Camia.</i>

129
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:52,263
-It's okay. It's gonna be okay.
-The mother and her daughter…

130
00:07:53,389 --> 00:07:57,435
both taken down by a wildflower.

131
00:07:58,186 --> 00:07:59,395
How do you like that?

132
00:08:02,064 --> 00:08:03,107
[Julio sighs]

133
00:08:03,941 --> 00:08:05,401
-Wait. Wait!
-It's okay. It's gonna be okay.

134
00:08:05,485 --> 00:08:06,652
-Let's go.
-It's gonna be fine.

135
00:08:06,736 --> 00:08:08,654
-[Julio] Oh.
-Bye, Helena.

136
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:10,573
You!

137
00:08:12,575 --> 00:08:15,119
Yes? Well?

138
00:08:16,746 --> 00:08:17,663
Mama!

139
00:08:20,666 --> 00:08:22,668
Wait. Why are they arresting my grandma?

140
00:08:23,252 --> 00:08:25,254
What is Lily doing here?

141
00:08:28,341 --> 00:08:32,970
You really don't remember
anything about that woman?

142
00:08:36,766 --> 00:08:39,352
Don't you remember her…

143
00:08:40,353 --> 00:08:42,772
doing something like this to you?

144
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:46,108
The same thing she did to your grandma.

145
00:08:47,652 --> 00:08:49,654
You mean that she also had me arrested?

146
00:08:54,951 --> 00:08:55,785
I have to go.

147
00:08:55,868 --> 00:08:57,036
Where are you off to?

148
00:08:58,246 --> 00:09:00,873
I have to clear up things about my past.

149
00:09:06,712 --> 00:09:09,090
[tense music swelling]

150
00:09:23,187 --> 00:09:24,855
[Magbanua] Should we
follow your grandson, sir?

151
00:09:24,939 --> 00:09:26,732
No, no. It's okay, Magbanua.

152
00:09:30,444 --> 00:09:33,531
If it's the truth he seeks…

153
00:09:35,116 --> 00:09:37,952
let's hope it's the truth he finds.

154
00:09:45,876 --> 00:09:47,169
Lily Cruz.

155
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:50,756
You are something else.

156
00:09:54,885 --> 00:09:55,886
[scoffs]

157
00:09:57,221 --> 00:09:58,180
Let's go.

158
00:10:02,351 --> 00:10:03,352
Good night.

159
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:20,369
<i>If a bunch of demons like the Ardientes</i>

160
00:10:20,453 --> 00:10:23,247
<i>couldn't bring me down,</i>

161
00:10:23,331 --> 00:10:25,875
<i>what makes you think an old dragon can?</i>

162
00:10:27,251 --> 00:10:29,879
<i>Checkmate, Helena Montoya.</i>

163
00:10:29,962 --> 00:10:32,256
<i>You just got slayed.</i>

164
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,260
Where were you?

165
00:10:36,344 --> 00:10:38,262
I've been looking all over
for you. Where did you go?

166
00:10:38,346 --> 00:10:40,640
I just went to the washroom.

167
00:10:40,723 --> 00:10:41,599
What washroom?

168
00:10:41,682 --> 00:10:43,517
Mama just got arrested,
and you weren't even there.

169
00:10:43,601 --> 00:10:44,685
-You're so worthless.
-No…

170
00:10:44,769 --> 00:10:45,895
No. That's what I want to know.

171
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:47,563
What happened? What did Lily Cruz do?

172
00:10:47,647 --> 00:10:49,231
I heard she exposed something?

173
00:10:49,315 --> 00:10:51,400
That woman has always been a troublemaker.

174
00:10:51,484 --> 00:10:53,778
She's done nothing but try
to ruin my family.

175
00:10:53,861 --> 00:10:56,864
First, it was Arnaldo,
then Papa, and now, Mama!

176
00:10:56,947 --> 00:10:59,867
-Speak of the devil and she comes!
-Emilia.

177
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:02,870
How dare you show your face
here after what you did!

178
00:11:02,953 --> 00:11:05,748
Shut your trap,
I didn't come here for you.

179
00:11:05,831 --> 00:11:09,752
I'm just making sure that
Red Dragon stays in her cage.

180
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:12,171
Oh, come on, Lily Cruz.

181
00:11:12,254 --> 00:11:15,257
Don't savor your victory
because it's not over yet.

182
00:11:15,341 --> 00:11:16,884
Once Mama gets out, I'll--

183
00:11:16,967 --> 00:11:20,513
What? Have me killed? Raped?

184
00:11:20,596 --> 00:11:22,765
Buried alive again?

185
00:11:22,848 --> 00:11:25,434
Didn't you try all that already?

186
00:11:25,518 --> 00:11:29,355
But you failed each time,
Emilia. Each time.

187
00:11:29,438 --> 00:11:33,651
While I've managed
to do everything I said I would.

188
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:36,570
Because I make sure I get the job done.

189
00:11:36,654 --> 00:11:41,826
So, you better be afraid,
Emilia. Be very afraid.

190
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:48,874
Calm down, Emilia.

191
00:11:48,958 --> 00:11:51,377
You know what? I've already said enough.

192
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:53,462
I need my lawyer present.

193
00:11:58,259 --> 00:11:59,260
Let's go, Emilia.

194
00:12:00,052 --> 00:12:00,845
[Raul] Emilia.

195
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:10,938
Mama, I already warned you
about Lily Cruz,

196
00:12:11,021 --> 00:12:12,773
but you didn't believe me.

197
00:12:12,857 --> 00:12:14,275
You're a powerful woman,

198
00:12:14,358 --> 00:12:17,278
and yet you still fell
for her booby traps.

199
00:12:17,361 --> 00:12:18,362
Yes.

200
00:12:19,447 --> 00:12:22,575
I underestimated her. I let my guard down.

201
00:12:22,658 --> 00:12:26,245
But it's okay. I'll play her little game.

202
00:12:26,328 --> 00:12:31,459
Let's see which one of us
raises the white flag first.

203
00:12:31,542 --> 00:12:33,919
Looks like you have something
planned for Lily Cruz.

204
00:12:36,255 --> 00:12:40,551
Like you said, baby girl,
your mama is a very powerful woman.

205
00:12:41,552 --> 00:12:43,179
I am above the law.

206
00:12:43,804 --> 00:12:46,432
No, wait, I am the law.

207
00:12:47,057 --> 00:12:49,143
And that Lily Cruz just declared

208
00:12:49,226 --> 00:12:52,188
a full-fledged war against Red Dragon.

209
00:12:58,736 --> 00:13:02,072
Thanks, Diego. I couldn't have
done this without you.

210
00:13:02,156 --> 00:13:07,328
Thank you for everything you've done
to help take Helena down.

211
00:13:08,537 --> 00:13:10,456
This isn't over yet, Lily.

212
00:13:10,539 --> 00:13:12,750
And I can't leave Red Dragon's group

213
00:13:13,751 --> 00:13:15,377
until she's definitely behind bars.

214
00:13:15,461 --> 00:13:17,171
I know that, Diego.

215
00:13:17,254 --> 00:13:19,298
And that's why I'm so worried about you.

216
00:13:19,381 --> 00:13:23,969
You're doing something
dangerous for me. For us.

217
00:13:25,137 --> 00:13:27,598
And that's why I want you out of there.

218
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:29,808
Out of Red Dragon's turf.

219
00:13:29,892 --> 00:13:32,061
But don't worry.

220
00:13:32,144 --> 00:13:34,980
I'll get you out of there real soon.

221
00:13:36,857 --> 00:13:39,902
Don't you worry.
I can take care of myself.

222
00:13:39,985 --> 00:13:43,030
What matters is that
Red Dragon doesn't get away.

223
00:13:43,739 --> 00:13:45,991
She has to pay for all her crimes.

224
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:48,953
Thanks again, Diego.

225
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:55,209
[soft music playing]

226
00:14:02,466 --> 00:14:03,467
[exhales heavily]

227
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:06,971
You've been standing there
for ages, Emilia.

228
00:14:07,638 --> 00:14:10,266
I think it'd be much better
if you just relax,

229
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:13,936
and not think about
your mother for a while.

230
00:14:14,019 --> 00:14:16,981
Because I'm sure she's innocent, right?

231
00:14:17,565 --> 00:14:20,860
I mean, she ought to be, right?

232
00:14:20,943 --> 00:14:22,903
You know, Raul? Can you just shut up?

233
00:14:22,987 --> 00:14:28,158
Don't think I've forgotten that
you left when Mama got arrested.

234
00:14:28,242 --> 00:14:30,911
To the men's room? I had to go, okay?

235
00:14:30,995 --> 00:14:33,163
I had to answer the call of nature.

236
00:14:33,247 --> 00:14:35,082
-Yeah, right, Raul.
-No. You know what…

237
00:14:35,165 --> 00:14:36,792
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

238
00:14:37,751 --> 00:14:40,796
Do you two know I can hear you both

239
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,172
from all the way in my bathroom?

240
00:14:42,256 --> 00:14:44,258
I was about to take a bath.

241
00:14:44,341 --> 00:14:49,263
But then, I didn't know the show
from earlier had a sequel.

242
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:53,267
You should've told me so I
could've ordered some popcorn.

243
00:14:53,350 --> 00:14:55,060
Oh, no, we were just…

244
00:14:55,728 --> 00:14:57,062
And you, Papa.

245
00:14:57,146 --> 00:14:58,355
You think I forgot?

246
00:14:58,439 --> 00:15:00,524
You didn't even try to help Mama.

247
00:15:00,608 --> 00:15:01,609
[Julio] Emilia.

248
00:15:02,526 --> 00:15:06,488
Lily Cruz and I have our own little war.

249
00:15:06,572 --> 00:15:09,867
And I don't want to get dragged
into her fight with your mother.

250
00:15:10,743 --> 00:15:14,371
Besides, you saw what
happened, right? There.

251
00:15:14,830 --> 00:15:16,749
Your amazing mother has fallen.

252
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:19,501
And this is what I've been
telling you all along.

253
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,171
You bet on the wrong horse.

254
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:29,136
Or, should I say,
you bet on the wrong dragon?

255
00:15:30,429 --> 00:15:32,681
But then again, you're a very lucky girl.

256
00:15:33,807 --> 00:15:36,602
Because your father is here.

257
00:15:37,436 --> 00:15:39,021
And he's back on top.

258
00:15:39,939 --> 00:15:42,441
I am, once again, in power.

259
00:15:43,651 --> 00:15:45,444
Well then, I'll leave you two lovebirds

260
00:15:45,527 --> 00:15:47,112
to iron out your problems.

261
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:48,864
Get a room.

262
00:15:53,702 --> 00:15:54,703
[door closes]

263
00:16:01,669 --> 00:16:03,253
Lily, I'm really happy that you and Diego

264
00:16:03,337 --> 00:16:06,131
were finally able to expose Red Dragon.

265
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:09,259
I really hope that's the end of her

266
00:16:09,343 --> 00:16:12,346
so that they can't hurt any more people.

267
00:16:12,972 --> 00:16:14,974
But this battle isn't over, Mom.

268
00:16:15,683 --> 00:16:19,019
We can't let our guard down
until Helena Montoya

269
00:16:19,103 --> 00:16:22,815
is sentenced and truly put behind bars.

270
00:16:23,315 --> 00:16:25,484
Why? Do you think
she has that many connections?

271
00:16:26,276 --> 00:16:28,529
Like the members in her syndicate?

272
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:33,534
It's not just that.

273
00:16:34,952 --> 00:16:38,330
I know how people like Helena work.

274
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:42,668
She can have her crimes absolved,

275
00:16:43,252 --> 00:16:45,295
or escape from the law.

276
00:16:47,881 --> 00:16:50,259
But I'll be one step ahead of her.

277
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:54,555
I'll take down whatever
plan she has in store.

278
00:17:07,651 --> 00:17:09,069
-Michelle?
-Governor.

279
00:17:10,362 --> 00:17:11,280
What happened?

280
00:17:11,363 --> 00:17:13,824
We were transferred
to a different department.

281
00:17:15,117 --> 00:17:17,619
-Who ordered it?
-Julio Ardiente, sir.

282
00:17:17,953 --> 00:17:20,122
He said you aren't the governor anymore.

283
00:17:27,963 --> 00:17:32,551
We've ironed everything out
while you were away, Governor.

284
00:17:33,135 --> 00:17:36,346
We've silenced everyone
who was against you.

285
00:17:37,806 --> 00:17:40,434
I can safely say that this town is yours.

286
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:42,519
Once again, you're the king now, sir.

287
00:17:43,729 --> 00:17:47,733
-I like your style, Magbanua.
-Thank you, sir.

288
00:17:48,317 --> 00:17:52,112
And I hope that you'll always
bring me news like this.

289
00:17:52,196 --> 00:17:54,865
-Always good news.
-[sighs]

290
00:17:54,948 --> 00:17:57,785
Well, that's the thing.
Since you were on vacation,

291
00:17:57,868 --> 00:17:59,661
Red Dragon was still able to acquire

292
00:17:59,745 --> 00:18:03,040
all of your gambling dens
here in Tierra del Viento.

293
00:18:04,249 --> 00:18:11,131
And I thought Lily Cruz clipped
the wings of that dragon.

294
00:18:12,674 --> 00:18:15,094
I thought she was already rotting in jail.

295
00:18:17,429 --> 00:18:18,764
Never mind.

296
00:18:19,973 --> 00:18:21,475
Anyway, this is what we'll do.

297
00:18:22,643 --> 00:18:26,146
Let us make sure we regain everything

298
00:18:26,230 --> 00:18:28,232
that was taken from me.

299
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:30,526
And this time, let's make sure…

300
00:18:31,193 --> 00:18:36,323
that what is mine remains mine alone.

301
00:18:38,033 --> 00:18:42,412
Especially Poblacion Ardiente.

302
00:18:43,413 --> 00:18:48,669
Because that place has
a very special spot in my heart.

303
00:18:51,755 --> 00:18:53,257
Watch, Magbanua.

304
00:18:54,258 --> 00:19:00,973
Watch as my plans unfold
before your very eyes.

305
00:19:06,728 --> 00:19:09,106
They haven't seen nothing yet.

306
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:16,280
Oh!

307
00:19:17,573 --> 00:19:18,448
[chuckles]

308
00:19:18,866 --> 00:19:20,742
Look what the cat dragged in.

309
00:19:22,161 --> 00:19:25,247
Good morning, Vice Governor Mateo Ruiz.

310
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:28,292
How can I be of service to you?

311
00:19:28,834 --> 00:19:30,502
What you're doing is illegal, Julio.

312
00:19:31,461 --> 00:19:35,465
The law has yet to decide
on your reinstatement.

313
00:19:35,549 --> 00:19:37,259
I can still have you arrested.

314
00:19:37,342 --> 00:19:39,178
But I'll allow you a chance to leave.

315
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:41,597
[groans]

316
00:19:44,183 --> 00:19:49,813
Vice, are you challenging
your duly elected

317
00:19:49,897 --> 00:19:57,446
and newly-reinstated governor
of Tierra del Viento, huh?

318
00:19:58,655 --> 00:20:00,115
Don't ask for trouble.

319
00:20:00,199 --> 00:20:02,451
The law is on my side.

320
00:20:02,534 --> 00:20:05,037
I'm still the governor
of Tierra del Viento.

321
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:07,789
[scoffs] There's a flaw in your law.

322
00:20:07,873 --> 00:20:09,208
[Julio chuckles]

323
00:20:09,291 --> 00:20:15,464
Or do you mean, Red Dragon,
your secret boss?

324
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:21,136
Your master is done, and so are you.

325
00:20:22,179 --> 00:20:28,060
So, if I were you, you should
just step down as vice governor,

326
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:31,813
and leave this place quietly.

327
00:20:32,105 --> 00:20:35,317
Make sure no one hears you.

328
00:20:36,026 --> 00:20:39,321
That would do you a lot better. Hmm?

329
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:43,367
Security, take this old man outside.

330
00:20:45,327 --> 00:20:46,328
[Magbanua] Ah, ah, ah.

331
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:48,622
[Julio] Oh.

332
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:54,461
You're really hot under the collar, Mateo.

333
00:20:55,963 --> 00:21:00,092
But it looks like your boys
are outnumbered by mine.

334
00:21:01,343 --> 00:21:08,141
Magbanua, will you please escort
Vice Governor Mateo Ruiz?

335
00:21:09,351 --> 00:21:10,936
Take the trash outside.

336
00:21:11,019 --> 00:21:12,521
Take him…

337
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:18,527
That looks better. You're more relaxed.

338
00:21:20,028 --> 00:21:21,738
[speaking in Spanish] Hot. Hot, Mateo.

339
00:21:30,747 --> 00:21:32,666
See you when I see you.

340
00:21:34,001 --> 00:21:35,877
[chuckles]

341
00:21:39,548 --> 00:21:44,261
Nobody but nobody beats Julio Ardiente.

342
00:21:46,221 --> 00:21:47,222
[sighs]

343
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:51,685
-[woman 1] We've got our time…
-[woman 2] So when?

344
00:21:55,314 --> 00:21:56,940
What are we still doing here?

345
00:21:57,733 --> 00:21:59,901
Aren't we going to help Red Dragon?

346
00:21:59,985 --> 00:22:01,320
We have a plan, Boss Diego.

347
00:22:01,862 --> 00:22:03,947
We're just waiting
for Mercedes' go-signal.

348
00:22:04,031 --> 00:22:08,744
She and Emilia are the only ones
Red Dragon has spoken to.

349
00:22:09,745 --> 00:22:11,121
This mission is in full force.

350
00:22:11,371 --> 00:22:13,707
You and your group
should prepare yourselves.

351
00:22:17,961 --> 00:22:20,630
All right, ma'am.
I'll leave you here to talk.

352
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:24,134
Don't worry.
I switched off the surveillance.

353
00:22:24,801 --> 00:22:25,802
Well done.

354
00:22:27,929 --> 00:22:30,348
Your guards are so obedient, Mama.

355
00:22:30,432 --> 00:22:31,516
[Helena] They should be.

356
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:33,769
Staying here isn't cheap.

357
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:37,439
So, you mean to say, Mama,
you have people in the agency?

358
00:22:37,522 --> 00:22:40,025
[Helena] Of course I have
connections everywhere, Emilia.

359
00:22:40,859 --> 00:22:43,361
We're only given 10 minutes.
So, let's begin.

360
00:22:43,445 --> 00:22:44,446
Okay.

361
00:22:46,990 --> 00:22:48,950
I'm going to move camps tomorrow,

362
00:22:49,034 --> 00:22:51,912
so you need to intercept
the transport vehicle

363
00:22:51,995 --> 00:22:54,122
before we leave the site.

364
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:56,374
Yes, Madam.

365
00:22:57,542 --> 00:23:00,879
We'll take a detour here, which
gives us a few minutes advantage

366
00:23:00,962 --> 00:23:02,881
before the enemy gets to us.

367
00:23:03,340 --> 00:23:07,177
Then I'll disperse our people,
so we won't have any setbacks

368
00:23:07,260 --> 00:23:09,054
and your escape will be smooth.

369
00:23:09,137 --> 00:23:10,263
[Helena] Yes. That's good.

370
00:23:10,806 --> 00:23:13,225
Don't worry, Mama. I'll review her plans

371
00:23:13,308 --> 00:23:17,145
before execution,
so Mercedes doesn't screw up.

372
00:23:17,229 --> 00:23:18,855
What are you trying to say, Emilia?

373
00:23:18,939 --> 00:23:19,940
Enough!

374
00:23:23,443 --> 00:23:25,278
Emilia is right.

375
00:23:25,362 --> 00:23:27,989
I haven't punished you
for your many failures yet.

376
00:23:28,073 --> 00:23:31,076
You're the reason why I'm here,

377
00:23:31,159 --> 00:23:33,578
and you will get me out.

378
00:23:33,662 --> 00:23:36,706
You are one of my most trusted servants,

379
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,875
so I'll give you another chance.

380
00:23:38,959 --> 00:23:40,460
Don't waste this opportunity.

381
00:23:40,544 --> 00:23:42,254
Is that understood, Mercedes?

382
00:23:42,337 --> 00:23:44,631
Yes, Madam. I won't let you down.

383
00:23:52,556 --> 00:23:53,598
As I was saying, ladies,

384
00:23:53,682 --> 00:23:56,184
if you were paying full attention earlier,

385
00:23:56,268 --> 00:23:58,311
this is where they'll be
taking Red Dragon.

386
00:23:58,854 --> 00:24:00,522
This is where you'll be waiting.

387
00:24:00,814 --> 00:24:02,899
And this is where you'll intercept them.

388
00:24:08,363 --> 00:24:09,239
And then what?

389
00:24:10,991 --> 00:24:12,450
Where will we take her?

390
00:24:12,534 --> 00:24:13,910
Who's going to help her escape?

391
00:24:14,661 --> 00:24:17,455
Just focus on your mission.
We'll take care of the rest.

392
00:24:18,123 --> 00:24:19,374
If you want this to succeed,

393
00:24:19,457 --> 00:24:21,918
then you'll have to tell me
every single detail.

394
00:24:22,002 --> 00:24:24,421
And that includes all the
Red Dragon's possible routes.

395
00:24:25,964 --> 00:24:29,718
The Madam specifically said
to limit the information

396
00:24:29,801 --> 00:24:32,053
available to those who
will be joining this mission.

397
00:24:32,804 --> 00:24:35,265
It seems like she doesn't
trust that many people.

398
00:24:35,974 --> 00:24:39,352
Not even her ally, such as yourself.

399
00:24:54,993 --> 00:24:57,037
Lily, I already asked them to make dinner.

400
00:24:59,039 --> 00:25:00,123
It's fine, Mom.

401
00:25:01,666 --> 00:25:03,877
I'm not really in the mood
to eat right now.

402
00:25:04,669 --> 00:25:06,630
I keep thinking about Diego.

403
00:25:09,132 --> 00:25:11,551
I'm still worried because
every minute he's out there,

404
00:25:13,178 --> 00:25:15,722
he's risking his life in the syndicate

405
00:25:16,723 --> 00:25:19,768
just so he can help me fight Red Dragon.

406
00:25:20,435 --> 00:25:24,189
Diego's doing all this
because he loves you.

407
00:25:25,273 --> 00:25:27,651
Anyone would do anything
for the one they love.

408
00:25:29,736 --> 00:25:31,613
Yes, I know.

409
00:25:32,530 --> 00:25:34,950
And that's why I want to end this.

410
00:25:35,033 --> 00:25:41,665
Not just for our family,
or for the people of Ardiente,

411
00:25:42,249 --> 00:25:43,750
but for Diego too.

412
00:25:44,793 --> 00:25:49,130
I'm the reason why he's still in there.

413
00:25:50,090 --> 00:25:54,094
Now, I want to make sure
he gets out of there alive.

414
00:25:55,345 --> 00:26:02,435
I hope the day comes
when we can finally be happy.

415
00:26:04,437 --> 00:26:06,231
When we can finally live in peace.

416
00:26:06,982 --> 00:26:09,192
The day when we can all be free.

417
00:26:12,112 --> 00:26:13,154
I hope so too, dear.

418
00:26:14,864 --> 00:26:16,533
I'll pray it comes true.

419
00:26:16,950 --> 00:26:19,494
[soft music playing]

420
00:26:26,126 --> 00:26:29,129
<i>I know how much it'll pain you</i>
<i>if Lily gets hurt.</i>

421
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:31,798
<i>I won't let that happen.</i>

422
00:26:35,969 --> 00:26:37,971
This is where they'll be taking
Red Dragon,

423
00:26:38,054 --> 00:26:40,890
while this is where Diego
and the others will be waiting.

424
00:26:41,850 --> 00:26:44,519
So, you'll be intercepting him here,

425
00:26:44,602 --> 00:26:47,480
because this is the last part
of the route that he knows.

426
00:26:47,981 --> 00:26:50,108
Then, we'll go straight ahead

427
00:26:50,191 --> 00:26:53,987
until Red Dragon
finally manages to escape here.

428
00:26:54,738 --> 00:26:57,866
And then, we drive
all the way to the suburbs.

429
00:26:58,241 --> 00:26:59,409
Do you understand?

430
00:27:00,994 --> 00:27:04,247
<i>Whatever it is you're planning</i>
<i>to help Red Dragon escape,</i>

431
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,584
<i>I'll make sure it fails.</i>

432
00:27:07,667 --> 00:27:11,171
[tense music swelling]

433
00:27:14,799 --> 00:27:17,385
[bright music playing]

434
00:27:18,219 --> 00:27:19,262
Anna!

435
00:27:20,138 --> 00:27:21,765
-Anna, we're back.
-[Anna] Jepoy.

436
00:27:21,848 --> 00:27:24,142
-Did you bring my fruits?
-[Jepoy] Here it is.

437
00:27:25,435 --> 00:27:27,354
These pineapples look so sweet.

438
00:27:27,437 --> 00:27:29,022
They're definitely sweet.

439
00:27:29,105 --> 00:27:31,483
We actually brought four, but
Marlon and I already ate one.

440
00:27:31,566 --> 00:27:34,527
-Sorry about that.
-Wait. Have some water.

441
00:27:35,653 --> 00:27:38,114
You must be tired. Here.

442
00:27:38,198 --> 00:27:41,284
Anna, look at these huge coconuts I got.

443
00:27:41,368 --> 00:27:42,577
These are good.

444
00:27:42,660 --> 00:27:44,204
Oh, thank you, Marlon.

445
00:27:44,996 --> 00:27:46,706
Could you peel some for us?

446
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:49,751
Sure. Batch told me
to take care of you. Wait here.

447
00:27:49,834 --> 00:27:51,628
-Thank you.
-Thanks.

448
00:27:53,046 --> 00:27:56,049
-Did you wait long?
-No. Look, you're all sweaty.

449
00:27:56,132 --> 00:27:58,551
-You sure you didn't?
-Not really.

450
00:27:59,135 --> 00:28:00,887
Let's have some of these. I'll peel them.

451
00:28:00,970 --> 00:28:01,888
Okay.

452
00:28:06,434 --> 00:28:09,646
Jepoy, I really hope
Lily and Aunt Camia are safe.

453
00:28:09,729 --> 00:28:12,315
Now that they put Red Dragon behind bars…

454
00:28:13,191 --> 00:28:15,860
I'm afraid she'll get back at them.

455
00:28:17,237 --> 00:28:19,948
You shouldn't worry too much
about them, okay?

456
00:28:21,825 --> 00:28:25,203
Diego and Lily are there
to protect Aunt Camia.

457
00:28:34,337 --> 00:28:35,338
Come here.

458
00:28:43,471 --> 00:28:44,556
Don't you like it here?

459
00:28:45,849 --> 00:28:46,891
It's quiet.

460
00:28:48,143 --> 00:28:50,645
We have all the time for each other.

461
00:28:54,524 --> 00:28:56,025
We're at peace here.

462
00:28:57,485 --> 00:28:58,319
Don't you agree?

463
00:28:58,403 --> 00:29:04,451
Jepoy, we didn't go with Lily
to face Red Dragon

464
00:29:04,534 --> 00:29:06,953
because we need to focus
on Arnaldo, remember?

465
00:29:08,246 --> 00:29:11,249
Because he chose to go with the Ardientes.

466
00:29:40,361 --> 00:29:41,362
Arnaldo?

467
00:29:41,988 --> 00:29:44,616
[tense music playing]

468
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:55,084
Agent Salonga, again,
I'd like to thank you

469
00:29:55,168 --> 00:29:59,547
and the entire team for
helping me catch Red Dragon.

470
00:30:01,049 --> 00:30:02,300
No problem, Miss Cruz.

471
00:30:02,967 --> 00:30:06,179
In fact, we should be
thanking you instead.

472
00:30:06,763 --> 00:30:09,724
If it weren't for the evidence
you gave us,

473
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:11,643
we probably wouldn't
have caught Red Dragon.

474
00:30:12,435 --> 00:30:13,394
Thank you.

475
00:30:14,729 --> 00:30:16,940
But, I have to warn you, Agent Salonga.

476
00:30:17,023 --> 00:30:19,943
I know what Red Dragon is capable of.

477
00:30:20,026 --> 00:30:23,863
She'll do everything to drop
the charges against her.

478
00:30:25,907 --> 00:30:29,160
[tense music playing]

479
00:30:32,664 --> 00:30:37,877
One more thing, you have to keep your ears

480
00:30:37,961 --> 00:30:42,632
and your eyes wide open at all times.

481
00:30:43,550 --> 00:30:44,551
Why?

482
00:30:45,885 --> 00:30:51,474
Because Red Dragon's men
can infiltrate even the NBI.

483
00:30:53,434 --> 00:30:54,477
Just saying.

484
00:30:56,521 --> 00:31:00,275
[tense music intensifies]

485
00:31:16,040 --> 00:31:17,041
[Anna] <i>Arnaldo?</i>

486
00:31:18,459 --> 00:31:20,044
Are you all right?

487
00:31:26,634 --> 00:31:28,761
I'm confused about a lot of things.

488
00:31:31,222 --> 00:31:32,432
I have so many questions.

489
00:31:33,558 --> 00:31:34,976
But I don't have answers.

490
00:31:38,521 --> 00:31:39,898
Who exactly is Ivy Aguas?

491
00:31:42,650 --> 00:31:46,863
The woman I know as Ivy Aguas,
why do you call her Lily?

492
00:31:50,950 --> 00:31:51,951
Well?

493
00:31:53,536 --> 00:31:55,163
I don't understand, who…

494
00:31:55,246 --> 00:31:58,041
Who's Nanny Carlotta? Why did I kill her?

495
00:31:58,958 --> 00:32:00,335
Why did I kill someone?

496
00:32:02,253 --> 00:32:03,254
Well?

497
00:32:03,630 --> 00:32:06,257
I don't understand… I have
so many questions in my head.

498
00:32:06,341 --> 00:32:08,176
But I don't have the answers.

499
00:32:08,259 --> 00:32:09,886
And nobody's giving me answers.

500
00:32:09,969 --> 00:32:11,679
No one! Not you… or you! Nobody!

501
00:32:11,763 --> 00:32:13,264
Especially you.

502
00:32:13,348 --> 00:32:15,058
What are you hiding from me?

503
00:32:15,892 --> 00:32:17,060
-Answer me!
-Arnaldo!

504
00:32:18,561 --> 00:32:21,439
Why don't you just forget
about everything, Arnaldo?!

505
00:32:22,649 --> 00:32:25,610
It won't do you or any of us any good!

506
00:32:25,693 --> 00:32:28,905
[somber music playing]

507
00:32:32,033 --> 00:32:35,036
This is your chance to start over.

508
00:32:37,622 --> 00:32:39,540
So you shouldn't throw it away.

509
00:32:53,554 --> 00:32:55,056
Arnaldo. Hey.

510
00:32:59,852 --> 00:33:02,188
Did he hurt you? Are you okay?

511
00:33:14,158 --> 00:33:17,120
[action music playing]

512
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:45,273
[reporter] <i>As of right now,</i>

513
00:33:45,356 --> 00:33:48,276
<i>we're told that Helena Montoya is being</i>
<i>transferred to a new prison camp.</i>

514
00:33:48,359 --> 00:33:53,114
<i>The philanthropist is accused of being</i>
<i>the syndicate leader "Red Dragon."</i>

515
00:33:53,197 --> 00:33:57,243
<i>The transfer is to ensure that she is kept</i>
<i>safe against any attempts on her life.</i>

516
00:33:58,745 --> 00:34:05,668
Now, let's see how far
your wings will take you,

517
00:34:06,836 --> 00:34:09,130
my beloved Red Dragon.

518
00:34:10,256 --> 00:34:14,177
[phone ringing]

519
00:34:14,260 --> 00:34:17,221
[ominous music swells]

520
00:34:21,225 --> 00:34:23,770
Camia, sorry, I didn't tell you earlier.

521
00:34:23,853 --> 00:34:25,229
Something important came up.

522
00:34:25,313 --> 00:34:28,066
It's okay, Damian.
Whatever it is, take care.

523
00:34:28,149 --> 00:34:29,567
Is Lily there?

524
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:31,444
That's what I'm worried about.

525
00:34:31,527 --> 00:34:32,987
<i>She's with the NBI right now.</i>

526
00:34:33,071 --> 00:34:35,656
They'll make sure that there
won't be any problems

527
00:34:35,740 --> 00:34:37,075
with Red Dragon's transfer.

528
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:40,453
Tell her that somebody tipped me off.

529
00:34:40,536 --> 00:34:42,622
Red Dragon's planning something big.

530
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:45,917
What do you mean?

531
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,168
What is she planning?

532
00:34:47,794 --> 00:34:49,170
That's all I heard, Camia.

533
00:34:49,921 --> 00:34:52,006
Just tell Lily to be careful.

534
00:34:52,632 --> 00:34:54,258
-All right, Damian. Thank you.
-<i>Bye.</i>

535
00:34:57,595 --> 00:34:59,555
-Let's go, Camacho.
-Yes, boss.

536
00:35:00,431 --> 00:35:02,433
[tense music playing]

537
00:35:10,942 --> 00:35:13,027
[sensual music playing]

538
00:35:26,165 --> 00:35:27,166
Hey…

539
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:29,961
Daddy.

540
00:35:35,049 --> 00:35:38,261
[Mercedes] <i>Mr. Oscar. The Madam</i>
<i>is quite busy at the moment.</i>

541
00:35:38,344 --> 00:35:41,389
<i>But I can set an appointment</i>
<i>so you two can talk.</i>

542
00:35:42,557 --> 00:35:44,809
I'm so glad you could join me.

543
00:35:45,351 --> 00:35:46,894
I have something for you.

544
00:35:46,978 --> 00:35:49,105
You made it. What's that?

545
00:35:50,106 --> 00:35:51,858
Is that champagne?

546
00:35:52,358 --> 00:35:54,944
-Yup.
-Hmm.

547
00:35:55,987 --> 00:35:57,613
I'm glad you're home.

548
00:35:58,322 --> 00:36:01,534
-For you.
-So sweet of you.

549
00:36:04,036 --> 00:36:06,122
I have a great idea.

550
00:36:07,331 --> 00:36:10,459
Why don't you join me?

551
00:36:11,335 --> 00:36:13,880
Maybe later. I still have
things to take care of.

552
00:36:15,047 --> 00:36:18,551
I know, Daddy. It's because you're sad.

553
00:36:19,427 --> 00:36:25,766
Because Red Dragon is
now exposed, and she got caught.

554
00:36:27,685 --> 00:36:32,315
And now that she's in jail,
that only means one thing.

555
00:36:33,441 --> 00:36:41,449
That power in your group
is up for grabs, right?

556
00:36:44,327 --> 00:36:52,168
And you know I love a man in power.

557
00:36:52,835 --> 00:36:53,878
And…

558
00:36:56,339 --> 00:37:02,053
I want you to be the most
powerful man of them all.

559
00:37:05,890 --> 00:37:09,518
Why don't you give me a nice scrub, Daddy?

560
00:37:13,022 --> 00:37:14,065
Sure.

561
00:37:17,735 --> 00:37:19,862
I missed you so much, Daddy.

562
00:37:21,656 --> 00:37:22,740
I missed you too.

563
00:37:26,160 --> 00:37:29,830
<i>You are my key to Red Dragon's kingdom.</i>

564
00:37:30,331 --> 00:37:35,169
<i>You'll be getting me into that syndicate.</i>

565
00:37:35,878 --> 00:37:41,509
<i>And once I'm in, I can have</i>
<i>everything I want and more.</i>

566
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:43,594
<i>I'm going to get back</i>

567
00:37:43,678 --> 00:37:47,265
<i>at every single person who ruined my life.</i>

568
00:37:53,646 --> 00:37:55,106
Thank you, Daddy.

569
00:37:58,192 --> 00:38:00,569
[action music playing]

570
00:39:19,106 --> 00:39:25,446
<i>Your Uncle Damian got a tip that</i>
<i>Red Dragon's up to something.</i>

571
00:39:25,988 --> 00:39:26,947
[phone dings]

572
00:39:35,998 --> 00:39:37,083
[phone dings]

573
00:39:37,166 --> 00:39:39,752
I'M READY, MOM. THANK YOU.

574
00:40:13,953 --> 00:40:14,954
Romulo.

575
00:40:16,956 --> 00:40:18,165
-Sir!
-[gunshot]

576
00:40:29,135 --> 00:40:32,304
[laughs]

577
00:40:45,317 --> 00:40:46,819
[phone ringing]

578
00:40:47,319 --> 00:40:48,320
Yes?

579
00:40:50,239 --> 00:40:51,615
Good job, Romulo.

580
00:40:52,116 --> 00:40:53,117
Good job, huh?

581
00:41:10,551 --> 00:41:12,136
Oh. That's one of our men.

582
00:41:15,306 --> 00:41:17,558
Damn it. Follow them.

583
00:41:23,939 --> 00:41:25,941
[action music playing]

584
00:41:41,248 --> 00:41:42,458
[tires screeching]

585
00:41:42,833 --> 00:41:43,876
Criminals!

586
00:41:43,959 --> 00:41:44,960
Get ready!

587
00:41:50,424 --> 00:41:51,967
[tires screeching]

588
00:41:53,886 --> 00:41:56,972
[gunshots]

589
00:41:58,224 --> 00:41:59,225
[gunshot]

590
00:42:01,810 --> 00:42:03,020
[phone ringing]

591
00:42:05,189 --> 00:42:06,190
Diego?

592
00:42:06,649 --> 00:42:08,859
Lily, get ready. She's on her way.

593
00:42:09,652 --> 00:42:12,905
I will. Thank you, Diego.
Thank you very much.

594
00:42:21,455 --> 00:42:23,874
<i>Here's the route Red Dragon's convoy</i>

595
00:42:23,958 --> 00:42:25,501
<i>will take when she escapes.</i>

596
00:42:25,709 --> 00:42:28,712
<i>Be on the alert, and be careful.</i>

597
00:42:39,265 --> 00:42:41,141
<i>Diego, thank you. Thank you for this.</i>

598
00:42:42,059 --> 00:42:44,103
<i>We're going to surprise Red Dragon.</i>

599
00:42:45,312 --> 00:42:48,816
<i>She won't know what's coming.</i>
<i>And she won't get away.</i>

600
00:42:57,449 --> 00:42:59,326
[action music playing]

601
00:43:33,193 --> 00:43:35,279
How did they know we were here?

602
00:43:35,654 --> 00:43:37,448
How did they learn about our route?

603
00:43:42,620 --> 00:43:45,456
Helena Montoya, get out of the car!

604
00:43:56,008 --> 00:43:57,801
Get out! Get out!

605
00:43:58,427 --> 00:43:59,219
[gunshot]

606
00:43:59,303 --> 00:44:00,888
Hey! Men, duck!

607
00:44:00,971 --> 00:44:01,972
[tires screeching]

608
00:44:02,348 --> 00:44:05,476
[gunshots]

609
00:44:05,559 --> 00:44:10,731
[gunfire continues]

610
00:44:15,361 --> 00:44:16,987
[gunshot]

611
00:44:19,990 --> 00:44:21,825
-[gunshots]
-Hurry!

612
00:44:28,248 --> 00:44:29,583
[gunshots]

613
00:44:34,338 --> 00:44:37,424
[car engine revving]

614
00:44:50,729 --> 00:44:52,731
[car engine revving]

615
00:45:11,125 --> 00:45:14,336
[gunshots]

616
00:45:15,629 --> 00:45:16,630
[gunshots]

617
00:45:16,880 --> 00:45:18,048
[tires screech]

618
00:45:19,842 --> 00:45:21,718
[car engine revving]

619
00:45:35,858 --> 00:45:37,860
[gunshots]

620
00:45:43,449 --> 00:45:45,159
[gunshots]

621
00:45:51,957 --> 00:45:53,750
[helicopter thrumming]

622
00:45:55,669 --> 00:45:56,670
[gunshot]

623
00:45:57,796 --> 00:45:58,755
[gunshot ]

624
00:46:01,133 --> 00:46:02,801
[gunshots]

625
00:46:15,022 --> 00:46:16,648
[helicopter thrumming]

626
00:46:30,329 --> 00:46:32,331
[tense musing playing]

627
00:46:38,670 --> 00:46:40,672
[action music playing]

628
00:47:09,868 --> 00:47:10,869
[Helena laughing]

629
00:47:13,664 --> 00:47:16,333
[action music playing]

630
00:47:38,105 --> 00:47:39,314
Open the door!

631
00:47:45,529 --> 00:47:49,324
-Open the door!
-Oh, Lily Cruz.

632
00:47:49,408 --> 00:47:50,200
[laughs]

633
00:47:53,829 --> 00:47:55,455
Oh my. Pathetic.

634
00:47:55,539 --> 00:47:56,665
-Open it!
-[laughs]

635
00:47:57,541 --> 00:47:58,542
Helena!

636
00:48:04,631 --> 00:48:05,674
Bye-bye.

637
00:48:06,216 --> 00:48:08,427
[helicopter thrumming]

638
00:48:10,137 --> 00:48:11,513
[Helena laughing]

639
00:48:20,480 --> 00:48:21,857
[Helena laughing]

640
00:48:34,244 --> 00:48:36,455
Bye, Lily Cruz.

641
00:48:37,372 --> 00:48:38,749
[Helena] Oh, my gosh.

642
00:48:39,833 --> 00:48:41,209
So pathetic.

643
00:48:53,430 --> 00:48:55,432
[action music playing]

644
00:49:00,312 --> 00:49:02,939
[no audible dialogue]

645
00:49:16,286 --> 00:49:20,165
<i>You know, Agent Salonga,</i>
<i>I'd be careful if I were you.</i>

646
00:49:20,248 --> 00:49:22,125
<i>I think my suspicions are correct.</i>

647
00:49:22,209 --> 00:49:24,252
<i>There's a snake amongst us.</i>

648
00:49:24,336 --> 00:49:26,171
<i>The Big Four want to set a meeting.</i>

649
00:49:26,254 --> 00:49:28,340
<i>Big Four? And who the hell are they?</i>

650
00:49:28,423 --> 00:49:30,967
<i>They are the four leaders of</i>
<i>Red Dragon's operations</i>

651
00:49:31,051 --> 00:49:33,178
<i>in the north, south, east, and west</i>
<i>areas of the country.</i>

652
00:49:33,261 --> 00:49:34,596
<i>Shouldn't we be talking about</i>

653
00:49:34,680 --> 00:49:36,640
<i>who's going to replace Red Dragon?</i>

654
00:49:36,723 --> 00:49:40,227
<i>It's quite obvious that I should take</i>
<i>Red Dragon's place</i>

655
00:49:40,310 --> 00:49:42,104
<i>since I'm her only daughter.</i>

656
00:49:42,187 --> 00:49:44,022
<i>Why don't we have an election?</i>

657
00:49:44,106 --> 00:49:48,360
<i>Emilia versus me</i>
<i>for Red Dragon's position.</i>

658
00:49:48,443 --> 00:49:50,946
[theme music playing]
